#: desc: Target and variable names can contain ., +, /, @ and quotes
#: issue: 90
-v COLOR=0 test/fixtures/Makefile.names
#: stdout
-----------------------
Available targets:
-----------------------
foo+bar   Target containing +
foo@bar   Target containing @
foo'bar   Target containing single quote
          This is not correctly parsed even by makefile-mode in Emacs :)
foo"bar   Target containing double quote
          ... same here

-----------------------
Command-line arguments:
-----------------------
FOO.BAR   Variable containing .
FOO+BAR   Variable containing +
FOO/BAR   Variable containing /
FOO@BAR   Variable containing @
-----------------------
